花朵与蓝色花瓣刺绣的围巾或披肩，在胸前垂落形成丰富的视觉层次感。背景纯黑简洁无干扰元素，突出人物主体形象。整体光线柔和均匀从正面打来，使面部细节清晰可见且富有立体质感，营造出庄重而温馨的艺术氛围。此图风格属于高质量摄影人像写真，强调文化传统之美与生命智慧之光。"],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":108,"type":"Comfly_nano_banana2_edit","pos":[680,120],"size":[400,540],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image1","name":"image1","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image2","name":"image2","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image3","name":"image3","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image4","name":"image4","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image5","name":"image5","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image6","name":"image6","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image7","name":"image7","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image8","name":"image8","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image9","name":"image9","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image10","name":"image10","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image11","name":"image11","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image12","name":"image12","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image13","name":"image13","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"image14","name":"image14","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"},"link":184},{"localized_name":"mode","name":"mode","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"mode"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"model"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"aspect_ratio","name":"aspect_ratio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"aspect_ratio"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"image_size","name":"image_size","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image_size"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"apikey","name":"apikey","shape":7,"type":"S